  "faq": {
    "title": "Questions about plans, billing and credits.",
    "items": [
      {
        "q": "Does one credit equal one reply?",
        "a": "Not always. The AI model your agent uses sets how many credits each reply costs. Customer messages are free, and the usage screen shows exactly what you have used."
      },
      {
        "q": "What happens if I exceed my message limit?",
        "a": "Buy an add-on credit pack from your dashboard, from 500 credits for ₹999 to 5,000 credits for ₹6,999, or move to a larger plan. Add-on credits work with every paid plan and expire at the end of your billing cycle."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I upgrade or downgrade my plan anytime?",
        "a": "Yes. Pick the plan that fits today, then upgrade or downgrade any time."
      },
      {
        "q": "How does billing work?",
        "a": "Plans are billed monthly or annually. Annual billing saves 20%, so Starter is ₹1,999 a month instead of ₹2,499."
      },
      {
        "q": "Which currency are prices shown in?",
        "a": "Prices on this page are in Indian rupees (₹)."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is included in the Starter plan?",
        "a": "1,000 credits a month, 50 MB storage and 50 web crawls, with ticketing, lead management, workflows, broadcasting, order tracking, custom AI personas, human handoff, every channel, basic analytics and email support."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is AI voice calling available?",
        "a": "Yes. Your agent can answer phone calls with the same knowledge base and handoff rules. Voice minutes are billed as credits."
      },
      {
        "q": "Do you offer custom pricing for Enterprise?",
        "a": "Yes. Enterprise starts at 50,000+ credits a month with custom pricing. Talk to sales and we will build a plan around your volume."
      }
    ]
  },
